  "cli.help.full": "\n{bold}{cyan}╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}  {bold}{white}mip v{{version}}{/white}{/bold} - {gray}just because npm sucks{/gray}                       {bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}  {gray}Plugins, Security and more!{/gray}                {bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝{/cyan}{/bold}\n\n{bold}{white}Core Commands:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip init{/cyan}                              {gray}Create new project{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip install{/cyan} {gray}[pkg]{/gray}                     {gray}Install packages{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip install -s{/cyan} {gray}[pkg]{/gray}                  {gray}SUPER FAST install{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip uninstall{/cyan} {gray}<pkg>{/gray}                   {gray}Remove package{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip update{/cyan}                            {gray}Update all packages{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip list{/cyan}                              {gray}Show installed packages{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Info:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip search{/cyan} {gray}<query>{/gray}                    {gray}Search npm registry{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip info{/cyan} {gray}<pkg>{/gray}                        {gray}Show package details{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip outdated{/cyan}                           {gray}Show outdated packages{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip why{/cyan} {gray}<pkg>{/gray}                         {gray}Why is this installed?{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Security:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip audit{/cyan}                             {gray}Check vulnerabilities{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip doctor{/cyan}                            {gray}System diagnostics{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Development:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip create{/cyan} {gray}<template> <name>{/gray}          {gray}Create from template{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip run{/cyan} {gray}<script>{/gray}                      {gray}Run npm script{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip exec{/cyan} {gray}<cmd>{/gray}                        {gray}Run local binary{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip link{/cyan}                              {gray}Link local packages{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Aliases:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip alias set{/cyan} {gray}<name> <command>{/gray}        {gray}Create alias{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias remove{/cyan} {gray}<name>{/gray}               {gray}Remove alias{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias list{/cyan}                           {gray}List all aliases{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias clear{/cyan}                          {gray}Clear all aliases{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Monorepo:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip workspaces list{/cyan}                   {gray}List workspaces{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip workspaces run{/cyan} {gray}<script>{/gray}           {gray}Run script in all workspaces{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Maintenance:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip cache clean{/cyan}                       {gray}Clear cache{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip cache size{/cyan}                        {gray}Show cache size{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip ci{/cyan}                                {gray}CI installation{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Examples:{/white}{/bold}\n  {gray}mip install -s express{/gray}                {gray}Super fast install{/gray}\n  {gray}mip install lodash --save-dev{/gray}\n  {gray}mip create react my-app{/gray}\n  {gray}mip why lodash{/gray}\n  {gray}mip cache clean{/gray}\n  {gray}mip doctor{/gray}\n\n{bold}{yellow}Super Fast Mode Features:{/yellow}{/bold}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}Parallel downloads{/gray}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}Streaming extraction{/gray}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}Smart caching{/gray}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}Lightning fast repeat installs{/gray}\n  ",

